WEBVTT

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:11.744
Heart, heart, heart...

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:13.779
just one more heart.

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:15.712
You might as well
be showing us

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:17.249
your hand, Neelix.

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:20.718
This is a game of
strategy, deception.

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:22.414
Never let the opponents
know your hand.

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:24.081
Right.

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:25.818
Right.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.327
Ten.

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:35.334
I see your ten and raise you 20.

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:38.134
Neelix?

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.570
I'm thinking...

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:45.838
20... another 20.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.108
If I didn't
know any better,

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:50.149
I'd say we're being hustled.

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:51.148
Ensign...

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:52.309
Oh, I'm not buying

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:53.682
the innocent Talaxian routine.

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:54.981
I don't know what
you're talking about.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:57.489
I've-I've... This is
the first time I've played...

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:58.489
What is it called?

00:00:58.558 --> 00:00:59.991
Poker.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.288
Look, why don't
we make things

00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:02.419
a little more interesting?

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:04.486
Forget the chips.

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:06.498
Let's bet on tomorrow's
work detail, all right?

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:09.126
Whoever wins this hand
gets the morning off.

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:10.499
I'm in.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:11.195
I'm in.

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:12.499
Sounds good to me.

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:15.096
What have you got?

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:16.665
Two pair.

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:19.303
Does... does that beat a flush?

00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:21.142
I knew you were bluffing.

00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:23.808
That beats me. Tom?

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:30.489
Battle stations!

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:35.160
And I had a full house.

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:30.934
I can't shake 'em.

00:03:31.077 --> 00:03:33.307
Return fire.

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:35.574
Why didn't our sensors
detect them?

00:03:35.648 --> 00:03:37.275
It looks like they used
a dispersal field

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:39.614
to mask their approach.

00:03:39.686 --> 00:03:41.244
Warp drive?

00:03:41.321 --> 00:03:45.087
No luck. Too much damage
to the plasma injectors.

00:03:45.158 --> 00:03:47.888
Harry, get down there
and see what you can do.

00:03:53.366 --> 00:03:55.527
Shields down 18 percent.

00:03:55.602 --> 00:03:56.762
Harry, status?

00:03:56.836 --> 00:03:59.327
I need time
to clear the injectors.

00:04:00.673 --> 00:04:03.198
Sir, the cube's power output
is fluctuating.

00:04:03.276 --> 00:04:05.244
Then we're still in the game.

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:06.869
Bring us about.

00:04:06.946 --> 00:04:09.210
Target their propulsion matrix.

00:04:09.282 --> 00:04:12.274
We've lost phasers.

00:04:12.352 --> 00:04:14.980
Arm photon torpedoes.
Fire when ready.

00:04:19.058 --> 00:04:20.650
We knocked out
their main propulsion system.

00:04:20.727 --> 00:04:22.160
Good.

00:04:22.228 --> 00:04:24.196
Now get us out
of here, Tom.

00:04:25.999 --> 00:04:27.796
They've got us
in a tractor beam.

00:04:27.867 --> 00:04:28.925
Harry,

00:04:29.035 --> 00:04:30.764
we need warp power now.

00:04:30.837 --> 00:04:32.930
We lost two more relays.
I can't!

00:04:35.808 --> 00:04:38.402
Harry?

00:04:38.478 --> 00:04:39.945
Harry?!

00:04:42.882 --> 00:04:43.940
Engines are off-line.

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.574
We are the Borg.

00:04:45.652 --> 00:04:48.143
Your biological and
technological distinctiveness

00:04:48.221 --> 00:04:49.745
will be added to our own.

00:04:49.822 --> 00:04:51.483
Resistance is futile.

00:05:12.979 --> 00:05:14.913
Neelix.

00:05:14.981 --> 00:05:16.744
Neelix!

00:05:16.816 --> 00:05:18.249
Commander?

00:05:18.318 --> 00:05:19.285
It's all right.

00:05:19.352 --> 00:05:20.512
You were unconscious,

00:05:20.586 --> 00:05:22.247
but I don't think
you're injured.

00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:24.586
I was dreaming you'd
been assimilated.

00:05:24.657 --> 00:05:26.591
Your subconscious
was jumping the gun,

00:05:26.659 --> 00:05:28.422
but not by much.

00:05:28.494 --> 00:05:30.257
From the look of this room,

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:33.766
I'd say we're
in an assimilation chamber.

00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:35.425
Where's Harry?

00:05:35.501 --> 00:05:36.934
He's not here.

00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:38.595
Well, we've got to find him.

00:05:38.671 --> 00:05:40.764
We need to get
our bearings first,

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.102
figure out what's going on.

00:05:42.175 --> 00:05:44.268
We're in a Borg cube,
and Harry's missing.

00:05:44.344 --> 00:05:45.606
That's what's going on.

00:05:45.678 --> 00:05:47.077
Sir...

00:05:52.352 --> 00:05:54.013
Nobody we know.

00:05:56.689 --> 00:05:59.556
Some kind of botched
assimilation?

00:05:59.625 --> 00:06:02.560
From the looks of it.

00:06:02.628 --> 00:06:04.118
What are they waiting for?

00:06:04.197 --> 00:06:07.166
They've got three more
potential drones here!

00:06:07.233 --> 00:06:08.222
Stay calm.

00:06:08.301 --> 00:06:09.563
Calm? We're in the
chamber of horrors,

00:06:09.635 --> 00:06:10.727
or haven't you noticed?

00:06:10.803 --> 00:06:11.895
We're not drones yet.

00:06:11.971 --> 00:06:15.065
If we keep our heads,
maybe we can find a way out.

00:06:15.141 --> 00:06:17.905
There's a force field
around this room.

00:06:17.977 --> 00:06:20.946
Let's try to disable it.

00:06:26.986 --> 00:06:29.250
Their ion trail ends
directly ahead.

00:06:29.322 --> 00:06:33.918
I'm detecting another vessel,
bearing 30 mark 112.

00:06:33.993 --> 00:06:35.585
It's a Borg cube.

00:06:35.661 --> 00:06:36.923
Red Alert.

00:06:36.996 --> 00:06:38.588
Alter course to intercept.

00:06:38.664 --> 00:06:40.598
Adjust shields
to rotating frequencies.

00:06:40.666 --> 00:06:42.099
Have they detected us?

00:06:42.168 --> 00:06:44.261
Unclear. The vessel's
holding position.

00:06:44.337 --> 00:06:45.929
As soon as we're
within sensor range,

00:06:46.005 --> 00:06:47.836
start scanning
for the away team.

00:06:47.907 --> 00:06:49.932
On screen.

00:06:50.042 --> 00:06:52.670
Their propulsion system
is off-line.

00:06:52.745 --> 00:06:54.440
The damage is not that severe.

00:06:54.514 --> 00:06:56.778
The drones should've
repaired it by now.

00:06:56.849 --> 00:06:58.111
Lucky for us they didn't,

00:06:58.184 --> 00:06:59.811
or we'd never have
caught up with them.

00:06:59.886 --> 00:07:00.818
Any sign
of our people?

00:07:00.887 --> 00:07:03.117
Not yet.

00:07:03.189 --> 00:07:05.555
They are targeting
our warp core.

00:07:05.625 --> 00:07:07.286
Shields are holding.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:08.884
Return fire.
Aim for their weapons array.

00:07:10.863 --> 00:07:13.297
Now they're going
after our impulse engines.

00:07:15.268 --> 00:07:17.031
That one was meant
for our sensors.

00:07:17.103 --> 00:07:18.035
They can't seem to make up

00:07:18.104 --> 00:07:19.230
their minds.

00:07:19.305 --> 00:07:21.899
Their attack strategy
is erratic, inefficient.

00:07:21.974 --> 00:07:23.999
And finished.

00:07:24.076 --> 00:07:25.805
We've disabled their weapons.

00:07:25.878 --> 00:07:28.176
That was too easy.

00:07:28.247 --> 00:07:30.511
Maybe they're in worse shape
than we thought.

00:07:30.583 --> 00:07:32.551
I'm picking up
non-Borg life signs.

00:07:32.618 --> 00:07:34.586
One of them is
definitely Talaxian.

00:07:34.654 --> 00:07:37.316
It looks as though they haven't
been assimilated yet.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:39.756
Try to get a transporter lock.

00:07:39.826 --> 00:07:41.418
Their shields are interfering.

00:07:41.494 --> 00:07:43.758
Target their shield generator
and fire.

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:46.390
Captain, I believe I can explain
the unusual behavior

00:07:46.466 --> 00:07:48.093
of these Borg.

00:07:48.167 --> 00:07:51.432
There should be thousands
of drones manning the vessel,

00:07:51.504 --> 00:07:53.904
but I'm picking up
only five signatures.

00:07:53.973 --> 00:07:56.840
We are the Borg.
You will be assimilated.

00:07:56.909 --> 00:07:59.275
Resistance is futile.

00:07:59.345 --> 00:08:01.540
It doesn't sound like
they've lost their confidence.

00:08:01.614 --> 00:08:04.082
Their shield generators
are too deep inside the vessel.

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:05.742
Our weapons can't reach them.

00:08:05.818 --> 00:08:08.446
Open a channel.

00:08:10.289 --> 00:08:13.884
Borg vessel, this is
the Starship Voyager.

00:08:13.993 --> 00:08:16.587
You're holding our crewmen.

00:08:16.662 --> 00:08:19.893
We're willing to cease firing
if you return them.

00:08:19.999 --> 00:08:21.899
Negotiation is irrelevant.

00:08:21.968 --> 00:08:24.436
You will be assimilated.

00:08:24.504 --> 00:08:26.904
Not today and not by you.

00:08:26.973 --> 00:08:29.703
Agree, or I'll resume firing.

00:08:29.775 --> 00:08:31.208
They are scanning us.

00:08:32.512 --> 00:08:35.913
We will return your crew members

00:08:36.015 --> 00:08:38.745
in exchange
for specific technology.

00:08:38.818 --> 00:08:41.309
Talk about unusual behavior.
The Borg negotiating?

00:08:41.387 --> 00:08:44.550
What technology?

00:08:44.624 --> 00:08:46.251
Your navigational deflector.

00:08:46.325 --> 00:08:48.418
Disengage it
from your secondary hull.

00:08:48.494 --> 00:08:49.825
Mute audio.

00:08:49.896 --> 00:08:53.093
If we surrender our deflector,
we'll be dead in space.

00:08:53.165 --> 00:08:54.530
We won't be able
to go to warp.

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:55.760
What would they
want with it?

00:08:55.835 --> 00:08:57.826
When their communications
array was damaged,

00:08:57.904 --> 00:09:00.134
it severed their link
to the collective.

00:09:00.206 --> 00:09:02.868
They intend to adapt
our deflector to regain it.

00:09:03.009 --> 00:09:06.206
And call for reinforcements?
That's the last thing we need.

00:09:06.279 --> 00:09:07.712
We'll have to stall them

00:09:07.780 --> 00:09:10.476
until we can find
another way out of this.

00:09:12.418 --> 00:09:16.218
I'll consider the exchange,
but first I want to be certain

00:09:16.289 --> 00:09:17.813
my crewmen are unharmed
and alive.

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:20.882
You have scanned our vessel.

00:09:21.027 --> 00:09:23.052
Our scans were inconclusive.

00:09:23.129 --> 00:09:25.256
We want to see them
for ourselves.

00:09:27.333 --> 00:09:30.825
You may transport
one individual.

00:09:32.805 --> 00:09:34.636
Seven.

00:10:07.506 --> 00:10:12.637
Proceed to Grid 63,
Subjunction 01.

00:10:58.391 --> 00:11:00.723
State your designation.

00:11:03.829 --> 00:11:06.923
Seven of Nine.

00:11:06.999 --> 00:11:09.263
These drones
have not fully matured.

00:11:09.335 --> 00:11:10.359
Where are the others?

00:11:10.436 --> 00:11:12.370
There are no others.

00:11:12.438 --> 00:11:14.599
The drones
aboard this vessel were...

00:11:14.674 --> 00:11:16.437
deactivated.

00:11:16.509 --> 00:11:18.636
We are the Borg.

00:11:24.016 --> 00:11:25.916
Seven of Nine...

00:11:25.985 --> 00:11:27.282
a Borg designation.

00:11:27.353 --> 00:11:28.615
She's like us.

00:11:28.688 --> 00:11:30.280
Not like us.

00:11:30.356 --> 00:11:31.721
She's damaged.

00:11:31.791 --> 00:11:34.726
Her infrastructure
has been removed.

00:11:34.794 --> 00:11:36.227
We could fix her.

00:11:36.295 --> 00:11:38.593
You will add to
our perfection.

00:11:38.664 --> 00:11:40.791
You are neonatal drones.

00:11:40.866 --> 00:11:42.629
You should still be
in maturation chambers.

00:11:42.702 --> 00:11:44.135
We've matured long enough.

00:11:44.203 --> 00:11:46.967
Doubtful. Your thoracic nodes
haven't formed yet.

00:11:47.073 --> 00:11:49.132
You're incomplete.

00:11:49.208 --> 00:11:51.073
You'll continue
to malfunction.

00:11:51.143 --> 00:11:54.772
You must return
to your maturation chambers.

00:11:54.847 --> 00:11:56.371
Comply.

00:11:56.449 --> 00:11:57.848
Don't listen to her.

00:11:57.917 --> 00:11:59.441
We tried to go back in.

00:11:59.518 --> 00:12:00.985
The chambers were off-line.

00:12:01.087 --> 00:12:03.282
What happened
to the adult drones?

00:12:03.355 --> 00:12:04.583
We don't know.

00:12:04.657 --> 00:12:05.589
Irrelevant.

00:12:05.658 --> 00:12:07.421
Don't tell her anything.

00:12:10.496 --> 00:12:12.657
This vessel has been
severely damaged.

00:12:12.732 --> 00:12:14.597
You won't be able
to repair it alone.

00:12:14.667 --> 00:12:15.929
I can help you,

00:12:16.001 --> 00:12:18.697
but first you must
release the hostages.

00:12:18.771 --> 00:12:20.898
That wasn't the agreement.

00:12:20.973 --> 00:12:22.201
I've modified
the agreement.

00:12:22.274 --> 00:12:24.139
I didn't realize I'd be
dealing with children.

00:12:24.210 --> 00:12:25.643
Your behavior is erratic.

00:12:25.711 --> 00:12:26.939
I can't be certain that you...

00:12:27.079 --> 00:12:29.479
No modifications.

00:12:29.548 --> 00:12:33.814
We show you the hostages;
you give us the deflector.

00:12:33.886 --> 00:12:35.513
Comply.

00:12:37.089 --> 00:12:39.319
Comply.

00:12:45.364 --> 00:12:47.298
Take me to them.

00:12:54.306 --> 00:12:57.366
If she tries to resist...

00:12:57.443 --> 00:13:00.003
assimilate her.

00:13:11.824 --> 00:13:14.258
Do you have a designation?

00:13:14.326 --> 00:13:16.089
Second.

00:13:16.162 --> 00:13:17.424
You were the second

00:13:17.496 --> 00:13:18.758
to emerge from the chambers.

00:13:18.831 --> 00:13:20.924
No, the first.

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:23.434
I could not establish order.

00:13:23.502 --> 00:13:27.939
I became second...
and he became first.

00:13:28.007 --> 00:13:30.942
So you've established
a chain of command...

00:13:31.076 --> 00:13:31.940
a hierarchy.

00:13:32.077 --> 00:13:33.704
We're a collective.

00:13:33.779 --> 00:13:35.940
A collective of
five on a vessel

00:13:36.015 --> 00:13:38.483
normally run by 5,000.

00:13:38.551 --> 00:13:40.849
What makes you think
you'll survive?

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:44.185
When we reestablish
our link with the Borg,

00:13:44.256 --> 00:13:46.417
they will come for us.

00:13:57.770 --> 00:14:01.001
Commander, we've got company.

00:14:04.176 --> 00:14:07.111
I wish to see
if they're injured.

00:14:12.184 --> 00:14:14.084
- Seven?
- Don't let their appearance

00:14:14.153 --> 00:14:16.485
fool you. They are in control
of this vessel

00:14:16.555 --> 00:14:18.318
and all of its armaments.

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:19.584
Are you injured?

00:14:19.658 --> 00:14:21.626
Nothing serious.

00:14:25.397 --> 00:14:26.694
The previous tenant.

00:14:26.765 --> 00:14:30.223
We were trying to perfect
our assimilation techniques.

00:14:30.302 --> 00:14:31.735
You failed.

00:14:31.804 --> 00:14:33.567
One of these captives
was attempting

00:14:33.639 --> 00:14:35.630
to disconnect
the security field.

00:14:35.708 --> 00:14:36.732
Actually, I was

00:14:36.809 --> 00:14:37.503
just trying to...

00:14:39.211 --> 00:14:41.577
That was unnecessary.

00:14:41.647 --> 00:14:43.114
He is not
permanently damaged.

00:14:43.182 --> 00:14:45.650
He learned his lesson.

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:52.950
The Borg are prepared

00:14:53.025 --> 00:14:55.323
to negotiate for your release.

00:14:55.394 --> 00:14:57.453
I will return for you.

00:14:59.398 --> 00:15:00.797
Give my regards to Harry.

00:15:12.711 --> 00:15:14.303
The deflector array.

00:15:14.380 --> 00:15:15.312
I'm not authorized

00:15:15.381 --> 00:15:16.905
to give you technology.

00:15:17.016 --> 00:15:19.541
I must report back
to Captain Janeway.

00:15:22.554 --> 00:15:23.919
Agreed.

00:15:24.023 --> 00:15:26.218
I also need to take
an adult drone

00:15:26.292 --> 00:15:28.590
and a datanode back
to Voyager for analysis.

00:15:28.661 --> 00:15:29.923
Why?

00:15:30.029 --> 00:15:31.587
Something happened
on this vessel

00:15:31.664 --> 00:15:32.926
that none of us understand.

00:15:32.998 --> 00:15:36.365
If it happens again,
it could endanger all of you.

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:46.369
No sign of Harry yet,
but there are parts

00:15:46.445 --> 00:15:48.345
of the cube that
we still can't scan.

00:15:48.414 --> 00:15:49.779
Could the drones
be holding him

00:15:49.848 --> 00:15:50.940
in another location?

00:15:51.083 --> 00:15:52.948
Unlikely. Seven said
they didn't seem

00:15:53.018 --> 00:15:54.610
to be aware of his presence.

00:15:54.687 --> 00:15:56.245
If he ejected
in an escape pod,

00:15:56.322 --> 00:15:58.415
we would have detected
his beacon by now.

00:15:58.490 --> 00:15:59.957
Try to activate his combadge.

00:16:00.092 --> 00:16:02.287
Match the carrier wave to
a Borg interlink frequency.

00:16:02.361 --> 00:16:03.760
They shouldn't detect it.

00:16:03.829 --> 00:16:05.262
Aye, Captain.

00:16:06.799 --> 00:16:09.529
What have we learned
from our friend here?

00:16:09.601 --> 00:16:13.264
The bigger they come,
the harder they fall.

00:16:13.339 --> 00:16:17.935
Behold the David
that slew our Goliath.

00:16:19.678 --> 00:16:21.305
A pathogen?

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:22.677
A spaceborne virus
that adapted

00:16:22.748 --> 00:16:23.806
to Borg physiology.

00:16:23.882 --> 00:16:24.906
It's inert now,

00:16:24.984 --> 00:16:26.212
but in its virulent state,

00:16:26.285 --> 00:16:28.219
it attacked the drones
and killed them.

00:16:28.287 --> 00:16:30.414
Why weren't
the juveniles infected?

00:16:30.489 --> 00:16:31.581
The maturation
chamber is designed

00:16:31.657 --> 00:16:32.919
to protect
developing drones.

00:16:33.025 --> 00:16:34.424
Malfunctions caused

00:16:34.493 --> 00:16:35.721
by the deaths of the adults

00:16:35.794 --> 00:16:38.092
lead several of the chambers
to open prematurely.

00:16:38.163 --> 00:16:41.064
Does this pathogen
only target the Borg?

00:16:41.133 --> 00:16:43.693
The Borg and other
cybernetic organisms

00:16:43.769 --> 00:16:44.701
it encounters.

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:46.431
You're not thinking
of using it

00:16:46.505 --> 00:16:47.767
as a biological weapon.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:49.398
If we can revive
the pathogen

00:16:49.475 --> 00:16:52.239
and reintroduce it,
we could neutralize the drones

00:16:52.311 --> 00:16:53.938
without harming
the away team.

00:16:54.013 --> 00:16:57.107
Neutralize? You mean
"murder," don't you?

00:16:57.182 --> 00:16:58.274
Captain, they're children.

00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:00.614
Need I remind you
that these "children"

00:17:00.686 --> 00:17:02.381
have committed
murder themselves

00:17:02.454 --> 00:17:05.048
in their futile attempts
to assimilate others.

00:17:05.124 --> 00:17:06.056
Seven...

00:17:06.125 --> 00:17:08.218
tell me something.

00:17:08.293 --> 00:17:10.124
You saw them,

00:17:10.195 --> 00:17:11.287
talked to them.

00:17:11.363 --> 00:17:13.558
Do you think
they'll kill the hostages

00:17:13.632 --> 00:17:15.259
if we don't give them
what they want?

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:20.267
Yes.

00:17:22.174 --> 00:17:25.337
I want that pathogen
as an option, Doctor,

00:17:25.411 --> 00:17:27.902
but I won't consider
using it until I've seen

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:29.607
these drones for myself.

00:17:29.681 --> 00:17:31.546
Think you can arrange that?

00:17:31.617 --> 00:17:33.949
Then you're with me.

00:18:08.353 --> 00:18:12.153
Computer, identify the source
of this com signal.

00:18:12.224 --> 00:18:15.216
Starship Voyager.

00:18:15.294 --> 00:18:18.730
I need to respond
on the same carrier wave.

00:18:18.797 --> 00:18:22.927
That procedure will require
significant modifications.

00:18:25.137 --> 00:18:29.267
Well, don't worry.
I'm way ahead of you.

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:49.527
Why are you here?

00:18:49.595 --> 00:18:52.291
I wanted to make
a new proposal.

00:18:52.364 --> 00:18:55.356
We've already negotiated.

00:18:56.869 --> 00:18:59.804
You've seen the hostages.

00:18:59.872 --> 00:19:02.340
Now give us the
deflector as agreed.

00:19:02.407 --> 00:19:04.637
Maybe it's hard
for you to accept,

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:07.474
but you don't have
to rejoin the hive.

00:19:07.546 --> 00:19:09.104
Our Doctor can remove

00:19:09.181 --> 00:19:11.206
your implants,
you can come with us.

00:19:11.283 --> 00:19:14.218
You were individuals
yourselves not long ago...

00:19:14.286 --> 00:19:16.345
children with families.

00:19:16.421 --> 00:19:19.322
You were abducted
and assimilated.

00:19:22.161 --> 00:19:24.561
I recognize your species.

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:26.188
You're Brunali.

00:19:27.866 --> 00:19:29.458
And you're Norcadian.

00:19:29.535 --> 00:19:31.435
Do you remember your world?

00:19:31.503 --> 00:19:33.903
A Theta-Class planetoid.

00:19:34.039 --> 00:19:36.200
Population: 260 million.

00:19:36.275 --> 00:19:38.539
Binary suns.

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:41.306
And what did it look like
when those suns set each night?

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:42.608
Can you remember that?

00:19:42.681 --> 00:19:43.739
Irrelevant!

00:19:43.815 --> 00:19:45.646
The deflector, now.

00:19:45.717 --> 00:19:46.911
We need more time.

00:19:47.052 --> 00:19:48.815
That deflector array
is essential to our...

00:19:48.887 --> 00:19:49.649
No.

00:19:52.157 --> 00:19:53.317
Give it to us.

00:19:53.392 --> 00:19:54.882
Or what? You'll assimilate me?

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:56.791
That won't solve your problem.

00:19:56.862 --> 00:19:59.194
I can't give you
Voyager's deflector,

00:19:59.264 --> 00:20:00.731
but maybe we can repair

00:20:00.799 --> 00:20:02.892
your technology.

00:20:02.968 --> 00:20:04.902
Clarify.

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:09.270
Seven knows a good deal
about Borg systems.

00:20:09.341 --> 00:20:11.434
You have two hours.

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:13.444
I don't know
the extent of the damage.

00:20:13.512 --> 00:20:14.843
It could take longer.

00:20:14.913 --> 00:20:17.313
Two hours...

00:20:17.382 --> 00:20:19.748
or your hostages die.

00:20:25.691 --> 00:20:28.683
Don't come back here, Captain.

00:20:48.914 --> 00:20:50.472
I bought us another two hours.

00:20:50.549 --> 00:20:51.880
The pathogen?

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:53.212
It should be ready by then.

00:20:53.285 --> 00:20:55.446
Did you see the away team?

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:56.544
I'm afraid not.

00:20:56.622 --> 00:20:59.318
But Seven assured me
our people haven't been harmed.

00:20:59.391 --> 00:21:00.983
I can't believe
we're negotiating

00:21:01.059 --> 00:21:02.287
with adolescent drones.

00:21:02.361 --> 00:21:03.885
They're not exactly drones.

00:21:03.962 --> 00:21:05.554
Mature Borg are predictable.

00:21:05.631 --> 00:21:07.690
They'll ignore you
or assimilate you,

00:21:07.766 --> 00:21:10.200
but these... juveniles,
they're unstable.

00:21:10.269 --> 00:21:12.032
They are contemptuous
of authority,

00:21:12.104 --> 00:21:13.867
convinced
that they are superior...

00:21:13.939 --> 00:21:17.670
typical adolescent behavior
for any species.

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:19.836
It's a transmission...

00:21:19.911 --> 00:21:21.344
from the cube.

00:21:21.413 --> 00:21:22.243
Seven?

00:21:22.314 --> 00:21:23.281
No.

00:21:23.348 --> 00:21:24.940
It's Harry.

00:21:25.017 --> 00:21:26.644
I'm clearing it up now.

00:21:28.987 --> 00:21:30.716
Delta Flyer to Voyager.
Respond.

00:21:30.789 --> 00:21:32.313
We're receiving you, Ensign.

00:21:32.391 --> 00:21:33.323
Where are you?

00:21:33.392 --> 00:21:34.586
Still in the Flyer.

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:37.128
It's locked up
in some kind of hangar bay

00:21:37.195 --> 00:21:38.890
along with two alien ships.

00:21:38.964 --> 00:21:40.693
I've isolated his coordinates.

00:21:40.766 --> 00:21:42.393
How close is he

00:21:42.467 --> 00:21:44.128
to their shield generator?

00:21:44.202 --> 00:21:45.396
Roughly 800 meters.

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:47.768
Harry, are there
any plasma charges

00:21:47.839 --> 00:21:49.101
aboard the Flyer?

00:21:49.174 --> 00:21:50.471
Yes, ma'am.

00:21:50.542 --> 00:21:51.907
In that case,
how do you feel

00:21:51.977 --> 00:21:53.444
about going for
a little walk?

00:21:53.512 --> 00:21:54.979
I could use the exercise.

00:21:55.113 --> 00:21:57.911
Tuvok will guide you
to the shield generator.

00:21:57.983 --> 00:22:01.510
If you destroy it, you won't
have to make the trip back.

00:22:01.586 --> 00:22:02.985
Understood.

00:22:14.566 --> 00:22:17.296
I have the technology
you've requested.

00:22:17.369 --> 00:22:19.530
Thank you.

00:22:23.575 --> 00:22:25.941
You were a drone for 18 years.

00:22:27.646 --> 00:22:29.375
Correct.

00:22:29.448 --> 00:22:31.643
I accessed your datafile.

00:22:31.717 --> 00:22:33.742
Why?

00:22:33.819 --> 00:22:37.186
I thought
it might be relevant.

00:22:39.291 --> 00:22:40.849
What else did you learn?

00:22:40.926 --> 00:22:43.895
You were assimilated
as a juvenile, like us.

00:22:43.962 --> 00:22:45.827
My parents were scientists

00:22:45.897 --> 00:22:47.626
studying the Borg.

00:22:47.699 --> 00:22:49.963
They took me with them.

00:22:50.035 --> 00:22:52.299
My childhood was short.

00:22:52.371 --> 00:22:53.633
Childhood?

00:22:53.705 --> 00:22:57.266
The years between birth
and physical maturity,

00:22:57.342 --> 00:22:58.934
when humanoids adapt

00:22:59.010 --> 00:23:01.638
to their roles as individuals.

00:23:01.713 --> 00:23:04.910
Perhaps you have memory
of yours.

00:23:05.050 --> 00:23:06.278
I don't know.

00:23:06.351 --> 00:23:08.251
What about your parents?

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:11.016
Do you remember them?

00:23:12.624 --> 00:23:13.556
No.

00:23:13.625 --> 00:23:15.786
No memories.

00:23:15.861 --> 00:23:18.694
Your subvocal processor
is malfunctioning.

00:23:18.764 --> 00:23:20.425
I can repair it for you.

00:23:22.367 --> 00:23:24.198
It's a slight adjustment.

00:23:27.072 --> 00:23:28.869
It won't be painful.

00:23:33.345 --> 00:23:34.471
The first told me

00:23:34.546 --> 00:23:36.707
my malfunction
could not be repaired,

00:23:36.782 --> 00:23:39.376
until we reconnected
with the collective.

00:23:45.357 --> 00:23:47.723
This color...

00:23:49.795 --> 00:23:51.820
My mother's hair...

00:23:51.897 --> 00:23:53.524
was this color.

00:23:53.598 --> 00:23:55.395
I thought we agreed...

00:23:55.467 --> 00:23:57.697
no irrelevant discussions.

00:23:57.769 --> 00:23:59.862
What is the punishment

00:23:59.938 --> 00:24:01.735
for disobeying the protocols?

00:24:01.807 --> 00:24:03.240
Deactivation.

00:24:03.308 --> 00:24:06.903
I engaged him in
this discussion.

00:24:06.978 --> 00:24:09.845
Return to your station.

00:24:30.202 --> 00:24:33.365
I found some
unsettling information.

00:24:33.438 --> 00:24:36.305
I examined their
communication records.

00:24:36.374 --> 00:24:37.341
The collective did receive

00:24:37.409 --> 00:24:38.876
the drones' initial
distress call.

00:24:38.944 --> 00:24:42.277
How long before they arrive?

00:24:42.347 --> 00:24:44.372
A vessel was not dispatched.

00:24:44.449 --> 00:24:45.643
The collective declared

00:24:45.717 --> 00:24:47.309
the neonatal
drones irrelevant

00:24:47.385 --> 00:24:49.512
and severed their link
to the hive permanently.

00:24:49.588 --> 00:24:52.421
They see them as damaged,
unworthy of reassimilation.

00:24:52.491 --> 00:24:53.480
Precisely.

00:24:53.558 --> 00:24:55.219
Are the drones aware of this?

00:24:55.293 --> 00:24:57.557
No. They don't
have the ability

00:24:57.629 --> 00:25:00.223
to decrypt the message.

00:25:00.298 --> 00:25:02.630
Once they learn they've
been rejected by the hive,

00:25:02.701 --> 00:25:04.692
they won't need our deflector.

00:25:04.769 --> 00:25:06.760
They might be willing
to release the hostages.

00:25:06.838 --> 00:25:08.829
Normally when drones
learn they're irrelevant,

00:25:08.907 --> 00:25:10.898
they deactivate themselves.

00:25:11.042 --> 00:25:13.101
But these neonatal drones
are unpredictable.

00:25:13.178 --> 00:25:16.773
They may not adhere
to Borg protocols.

00:25:19.417 --> 00:25:20.850
There is another option.

00:25:23.121 --> 00:25:25.885
We could invite them
to Voyager.

00:25:25.957 --> 00:25:28.687
When they realize they have
no place else to go...

00:25:28.760 --> 00:25:29.920
If you're suggesting

00:25:30.061 --> 00:25:32.086
transforming them
into individuals,

00:25:32.163 --> 00:25:33.721
that would be
extremely difficult.

00:25:33.798 --> 00:25:36.767
You turned out
pretty well, Seven.

00:25:36.835 --> 00:25:40.669
That's because I was prepared
before you encountered me.

00:25:40.739 --> 00:25:42.263
What do you mean?

00:25:42.340 --> 00:25:46.538
When I was first captured
by the Borg,

00:25:46.611 --> 00:25:49.273
I was young and frightened.

00:25:49.347 --> 00:25:52.942
I watched my parents
assimilated.

00:25:53.051 --> 00:25:55.679
Then I was placed
in a maturation chamber,

00:25:55.754 --> 00:25:58.086
and the hive mind began
to restructure

00:25:58.156 --> 00:26:02.024
my synaptic pathways,
purge my individuality.

00:26:02.093 --> 00:26:04.823
When I emerged five years later,

00:26:04.896 --> 00:26:07.262
the turmoil
of my forced assimilation

00:26:07.332 --> 00:26:10.130
had been replaced with order.

00:26:10.201 --> 00:26:13.432
You may not be aware
of this, Captain,

00:26:13.505 --> 00:26:17.908
but that order continues to be
a source of strength for me.

00:26:17.976 --> 00:26:21.139
I could not have regained
my humanity without it.

00:26:21.212 --> 00:26:24.375
I appreciate your insights.

00:26:26.718 --> 00:26:28.583
But just because they
didn't have the benefit

00:26:28.653 --> 00:26:30.382
of your Borg upbringing,

00:26:30.455 --> 00:26:32.923
doesn't mean we're going
to turn our backs on them.

00:26:33.024 --> 00:26:34.355
There has to be another way.

00:26:34.426 --> 00:26:37.953
Not all drones
can be saved, Captain.

00:26:40.065 --> 00:26:42.932
Continue the repairs
aboard the Borg cube.

00:26:43.034 --> 00:26:46.731
We'll hold onto this
information for now.

00:26:46.805 --> 00:26:48.033
Yes, Captain.

00:26:48.106 --> 00:26:51.132
They do have one thing
going for them.

00:26:53.144 --> 00:26:55.339
You.

00:26:55.413 --> 00:26:57.210
If there's anyone
who can reach them,

00:26:57.282 --> 00:26:59.182
it's you.

00:27:08.860 --> 00:27:12.352
Three of hearts
on a transwarp conduit.

00:27:12.430 --> 00:27:13.590
Ensign?

00:27:13.665 --> 00:27:16.634
King of clubs...

00:27:16.701 --> 00:27:18.464
on a power coupling.

00:27:18.536 --> 00:27:20.504
I'm marking my route

00:27:20.572 --> 00:27:23.564
with playing cards in case I
have to come back this same way.

00:27:23.642 --> 00:27:25.906
You shouldn't distract yourself,
Mr. Kim.

00:27:25.977 --> 00:27:27.911
I need a little distraction.

00:27:27.979 --> 00:27:32.075
This hike is bringing up
some bad memories.

00:27:32.150 --> 00:27:35.449
An earlier visit to a Borg cube?

00:27:35.520 --> 00:27:37.750
Nope, haunted house
my parents took me to

00:27:37.822 --> 00:27:39.187
when I was six.

00:27:39.257 --> 00:27:42.954
Borg vessels may be forbidding,
but they are not haunted.

00:27:44.996 --> 00:27:47.055
Tuvok?

00:27:47.132 --> 00:27:48.497
Turn left, Ensign.

00:27:50.669 --> 00:27:53.467
Nine of diamonds on a data node.

00:27:55.040 --> 00:27:57.406
The resonance field
collapsed.

00:27:57.475 --> 00:27:59.807
It'll take an hour
to reinitialize.

00:27:59.878 --> 00:28:01.277
These delays are intentional.

00:28:01.346 --> 00:28:03.871
I'm working
as efficiently as I can.

00:28:03.948 --> 00:28:06.917
Examine my work for yourself
if you have doubts.

00:28:08.653 --> 00:28:10.382
This data's flawed.

00:28:10.455 --> 00:28:12.889
More likely it's
your understanding

00:28:13.024 --> 00:28:14.753
of quadric field
theory that's flawed.

00:28:14.826 --> 00:28:16.851
Ignore her.

00:28:16.928 --> 00:28:18.259
She's trying to divide us.

00:28:18.329 --> 00:28:20.297
They rely on you.

00:28:20.365 --> 00:28:22.765
Yet you lack the skills
necessary to ensure

00:28:22.834 --> 00:28:23.892
their survival.

00:28:24.035 --> 00:28:26.299
We've managed so far.

00:28:26.371 --> 00:28:28.100
We're Borg.

00:28:28.173 --> 00:28:29.731
You've forgotten
what that means.

00:28:29.808 --> 00:28:32.538
The unity of the collective...

00:28:32.610 --> 00:28:34.601
common goals...

00:28:34.679 --> 00:28:35.907
the quest for perfection...

00:28:35.980 --> 00:28:38.380
I have not forgotten.

00:28:38.450 --> 00:28:39.917
But you don't need
to remain drones

00:28:40.018 --> 00:28:42.077
to experience those things.

00:28:43.888 --> 00:28:45.822
Come back with me to Voyager.

00:28:47.192 --> 00:28:48.921
38 minutes.

00:28:49.027 --> 00:28:51.655
You're wasting time.

00:28:55.600 --> 00:28:58.330
Another maturation chamber
is malfunctioning.

00:29:07.612 --> 00:29:10.137
Its autonomic nervous
system is failing.

00:29:10.215 --> 00:29:11.477
It's Borg.

00:29:11.549 --> 00:29:13.483
It will adapt.

00:29:13.551 --> 00:29:15.678
It's not adapting.

00:29:15.754 --> 00:29:16.721
Let Seven help.

00:29:26.297 --> 00:29:28.891
We can modulate the stasis field
to stabilize its functions

00:29:29.033 --> 00:29:30.500
at least temporarily.

00:29:30.568 --> 00:29:31.830
Assist me.

00:29:31.903 --> 00:29:33.564
The field is degrading.

00:29:33.638 --> 00:29:35.367
We need to transport it

00:29:35.440 --> 00:29:36.839
into an incubation pod...
quickly.

00:30:12.510 --> 00:30:14.774
Why is it doing that?

00:30:14.846 --> 00:30:17.508
It's respiratory
system is impaired.

00:30:17.582 --> 00:30:19.777
And this incubation pod
is malfunctioning.

00:30:19.851 --> 00:30:21.785
We must transport this
infant to Voyager.

00:30:21.853 --> 00:30:22.842
No.

00:30:22.921 --> 00:30:25.583
The drone is part
of our collective.

00:30:27.659 --> 00:30:29.627
Not if it dies.

00:30:39.704 --> 00:30:42.639
Tetryon levels are rising.
I'm getting closer.

00:30:42.707 --> 00:30:44.834
The shield generator
should be directly ahead.

00:30:48.313 --> 00:30:49.439
I see it.

00:30:58.056 --> 00:31:00.752
The first charge is in place.

00:31:02.160 --> 00:31:03.286
Tuvok?

00:31:20.011 --> 00:31:21.308
Hello?

00:31:21.379 --> 00:31:23.745
You left these.

00:31:29.587 --> 00:31:31.487
I like her.

00:31:31.556 --> 00:31:32.921
She looks like Seven of Nine.

00:31:32.991 --> 00:31:35.425
Is Seven your friend?

00:31:35.493 --> 00:31:37.484
You know, she's my friend, too.

00:31:37.562 --> 00:31:38.893
Maybe someday...

00:31:38.963 --> 00:31:41.363
Your weapon won't work here.

00:31:41.432 --> 00:31:43.423
Dampening field.

00:31:46.037 --> 00:31:47.971
How long has it been
since you lost contact?

00:31:48.039 --> 00:31:48.971
Four or five minutes.

00:31:49.107 --> 00:31:50.074
His bio-signs?

00:31:50.141 --> 00:31:51.631
Doctor to the Captain.

00:31:51.709 --> 00:31:53.438
Please report
to Sick Bay immediately.

00:31:53.511 --> 00:31:54.478
On my way.

00:31:54.545 --> 00:31:56.342
Keep looking for him.

00:31:57.749 --> 00:31:58.977
What's the emergency?

00:31:59.117 --> 00:32:01.347
I thought you should see
for yourself.

00:32:01.419 --> 00:32:03.512
Somebody left a bundle
on our doorstep.

00:32:03.588 --> 00:32:04.714
I turned around

00:32:04.789 --> 00:32:07.019
and there she was,
lying on a bio-bed.

00:32:07.091 --> 00:32:09.252
Seven must have
beamed her here.

00:32:09.327 --> 00:32:10.259
A good thing, too.

00:32:10.328 --> 00:32:11.818
A few more minutes

00:32:11.896 --> 00:32:15.559
and I wouldn't have been able
to do anything for her.

00:32:15.633 --> 00:32:17.897
It's hard to believe
she could grow up

00:32:17.969 --> 00:32:20.597
to be a drone.

00:32:27.078 --> 00:32:29.979
Hold her for a moment
while I take some readings.

00:32:37.155 --> 00:32:42.024
Oh. I guess she just
wanted to be held.

00:32:45.930 --> 00:32:47.329
Oh.

00:32:49.200 --> 00:32:51.191
The pathogen.

00:32:51.269 --> 00:32:53.794
I finished synthesizing it.

00:32:53.871 --> 00:32:56.362
Start working with Tuvok
on a way to deploy

00:32:56.441 --> 00:32:58.170
the virus.

00:32:58.242 --> 00:33:00.403
Captain, you don't
seriously plan to use it.

00:33:00.478 --> 00:33:02.446
If I have to.

00:33:05.483 --> 00:33:07.576
Let's just hope your
brothers and sisters

00:33:07.652 --> 00:33:10.120
don't force my hand.

00:33:11.756 --> 00:33:13.485
You complain of delays,

00:33:13.558 --> 00:33:15.526
then you interrupt my work.

00:33:15.593 --> 00:33:17.857
Can you identify this?

00:33:19.330 --> 00:33:21.059
It's a plasma charge.

00:33:25.837 --> 00:33:28.897
You tried to deceive us.

00:33:34.946 --> 00:33:37.881
Nanoprobes were injected
into his bloodstream.

00:33:37.949 --> 00:33:40.281
He won't survive
without medical attention.

00:33:40.351 --> 00:33:42.216
Call your Captain.

00:33:42.286 --> 00:33:44.083
Tell her to give us
the deflector.

00:33:44.155 --> 00:33:45.452
That won't be necessary.

00:33:45.523 --> 00:33:47.320
I only need a few
more minutes to repair...

00:33:47.392 --> 00:33:48.950
No more delays.

00:33:49.093 --> 00:33:52.119
No more deceptions.

00:33:52.196 --> 00:33:53.163
The deflector.

00:33:57.635 --> 00:34:00.399
Resistance is futile.

00:34:05.476 --> 00:34:07.068
Comply.

00:34:07.145 --> 00:34:09.739
Return Harry Kim;
then we'll talk.

00:34:09.814 --> 00:34:11.281
We've talked enough.

00:34:11.349 --> 00:34:13.544
Your requests are irrelevant.

00:34:13.618 --> 00:34:16.485
Comply, or we'll assimilate
the others.

00:34:20.825 --> 00:34:23.692
It'll take us at least an hour
to dismantle the deflector

00:34:23.761 --> 00:34:24.750
and transfer the components...

00:34:24.829 --> 00:34:25.761
Now.

00:34:25.830 --> 00:34:28.196
I can't give it to you now.

00:34:28.266 --> 00:34:31.099
It's complex technology
that's part of our ship.

00:34:31.169 --> 00:34:32.659
We can't simply remove it,

00:34:32.737 --> 00:34:34.671
and no amount
of threats from you

00:34:34.739 --> 00:34:36.798
is going to change that.

00:34:39.844 --> 00:34:42.142
They've locked a tractor beam
onto the deflector.

00:34:42.213 --> 00:34:43.612
They're trying
to tear it off.

00:34:43.681 --> 00:34:44.807
Hull stress is increasing.

00:34:44.882 --> 00:34:46.179
Breaches on Decks 10 and 11.

00:34:46.250 --> 00:34:50.152
Increase shield strength
and randomize the harmonics.

00:34:52.924 --> 00:34:54.721
They're adapting.

00:35:00.698 --> 00:35:02.427
Even with Voyager's
deflector,

00:35:02.500 --> 00:35:04.491
your efforts to
return to the hive

00:35:04.569 --> 00:35:05.695
will fail.

00:35:05.770 --> 00:35:07.704
They'll come for us.

00:35:07.772 --> 00:35:09.740
No, they won't.

00:35:11.175 --> 00:35:13.405
The Borg received your message,

00:35:13.478 --> 00:35:15.207
but chose to ignore it.

00:35:15.279 --> 00:35:17.770
They consider you irrelevant.

00:35:17.849 --> 00:35:19.441
Irrelevant?

00:35:19.517 --> 00:35:20.916
We are damaged.

00:35:21.018 --> 00:35:22.849
They don't want us.

00:35:22.920 --> 00:35:24.547
Ignore her.

00:35:24.622 --> 00:35:26.146
It's another lie.

00:35:26.224 --> 00:35:29.887
Their reply is
in data grid 426.

00:35:29.961 --> 00:35:31.758
Use decryption
protocol theta-3.

00:35:31.829 --> 00:35:33.558
Return to your station.

00:35:45.910 --> 00:35:48.538
It's another deception.

00:35:48.613 --> 00:35:51.309
She's manipulating us.

00:35:51.382 --> 00:35:53.942
The transmission
is authentic.

00:35:57.355 --> 00:35:59.220
It's a mistake.

00:35:59.290 --> 00:36:01.781
The collective does not
tolerate imperfection.

00:36:01.859 --> 00:36:04.487
Then we'll assimilate
more species...

00:36:04.562 --> 00:36:06.792
prove we're worthy.

00:36:10.568 --> 00:36:12.365
Hull stress is reaching
critical levels.

00:36:12.436 --> 00:36:14.734
Reroute all emergency power
to structural integrity.

00:36:14.805 --> 00:36:17.603
That'll buy us
another minute at most.

00:36:17.675 --> 00:36:19.905
Captain, I found a fluctuation

00:36:20.011 --> 00:36:21.911
in their shield grid
near a plasma duct.

00:36:22.013 --> 00:36:24.504
It's too intermittent
to beam out the hostages,

00:36:24.582 --> 00:36:27.050
but we could use it
to deploy the pathogen.

00:36:31.355 --> 00:36:32.720
Captain...

00:36:32.790 --> 00:36:34.087
Not yet.

00:36:34.158 --> 00:36:35.523
There is no alternative.

00:36:35.593 --> 00:36:37.220
There's always an alternative.

00:36:37.295 --> 00:36:38.728
We just need to find it.

00:36:41.966 --> 00:36:43.433
Their tractor
beam draws power

00:36:43.501 --> 00:36:45.560
from the same grid
as their shield matrix.

00:36:47.104 --> 00:36:48.264
If we use the deflector

00:36:48.339 --> 00:36:50.398
to send a feedback pulse
along the beam,

00:36:50.474 --> 00:36:52.533
it could disrupt
their shields. Do it.

00:36:52.610 --> 00:36:55.272
Rerouting more plasma.

00:36:55.346 --> 00:36:56.278
If this doesn't work,

00:36:56.347 --> 00:36:57.905
it'll do more damage
to us than the cube.

00:36:57.982 --> 00:36:58.949
It'll work.

00:36:59.016 --> 00:36:59.948
Prepare to fire.

00:37:01.519 --> 00:37:05.751
You have no future
with the Borg...

00:37:05.823 --> 00:37:07.484
but you do with Voyager...

00:37:07.558 --> 00:37:10.493
a chance to reclaim
your real lives.

00:37:10.561 --> 00:37:13.325
What do you know
about real lives?

00:37:14.865 --> 00:37:17.265
Does he speak
for all of you?

00:37:17.335 --> 00:37:20.133
You should make your
decisions yourself,

00:37:20.204 --> 00:37:21.296
as individuals.

00:37:26.277 --> 00:37:28.211
They are sending
a feedback pulse

00:37:28.279 --> 00:37:29.769
through our tractor beam.

00:37:29.847 --> 00:37:32.338
It's overloading
our shield matrix.

00:37:32.416 --> 00:37:34.384
Adapt!

00:37:39.757 --> 00:37:40.689
Their tractor beam

00:37:40.758 --> 00:37:41.690
is fluctuating.

00:37:41.759 --> 00:37:43.090
Their shields are dropping.

00:37:43.160 --> 00:37:44.855
I've got a partial lock
on the away team.

00:37:44.929 --> 00:37:46.760
Boosting the confinement beam.

00:37:46.831 --> 00:37:48.128
I've got three of them.

00:37:48.199 --> 00:37:49.826
Confirmed.

00:37:49.900 --> 00:37:52.801
Chakotay, Paris and Neelix
are in Transporter Room 2.

00:37:52.870 --> 00:37:54.269
What about Seven and Harry?

00:37:54.338 --> 00:37:55.737
They must be in a section

00:37:55.806 --> 00:37:56.773
that's still shielded.

00:37:56.841 --> 00:37:58.706
Amplify the feedback pulse.

00:38:02.446 --> 00:38:04.573
The other captives are gone.

00:38:05.683 --> 00:38:07.708
The shields around this chamber
are failing.

00:38:07.785 --> 00:38:09.377
Instructions.

00:38:15.559 --> 00:38:16.924
Lower your shields.

00:38:21.565 --> 00:38:23.430
Lower the shields!

00:38:27.038 --> 00:38:28.096
No!

00:38:41.852 --> 00:38:43.046
Leave her alone.

00:38:43.120 --> 00:38:45.247
Get back to your station.

00:38:45.323 --> 00:38:47.917
Do what I say.

00:38:48.025 --> 00:38:49.356
What you say?

00:38:49.427 --> 00:38:51.418
I thought we were
a collective.

00:38:51.495 --> 00:38:53.429
One mind, one voice.

00:38:53.497 --> 00:38:56.330
I protected you...

00:38:56.400 --> 00:38:58.391
gave you order.

00:38:58.469 --> 00:38:59.401
Your order.

00:38:59.470 --> 00:39:01.631
Your rules.

00:39:01.706 --> 00:39:04.504
Their feedback pulse
is overloading

00:39:04.575 --> 00:39:06.167
the induction grids.

00:39:09.947 --> 00:39:12.245
This vessel will be destroyed.

00:39:12.316 --> 00:39:13.647
We must evacuate.

00:39:13.718 --> 00:39:14.776
No!

00:39:14.852 --> 00:39:16.444
Assist me!

00:39:30.801 --> 00:39:32.496
You're damaged. Lie still.

00:39:32.570 --> 00:39:35.368
We have to resist.

00:39:35.439 --> 00:39:38.465
The collective will come for us.

00:39:41.178 --> 00:39:43.612
His cortical implants
are depolarizing.

00:39:45.383 --> 00:39:47.146
I can't help him.

00:39:52.390 --> 00:39:54.290
We'll find a new home.

00:39:54.358 --> 00:39:56.326
You'll see.

00:39:57.828 --> 00:40:00.058
W-we are Borg.

00:40:02.833 --> 00:40:04.892
Yes.

00:40:04.969 --> 00:40:06.800
We are Borg.

00:40:21.585 --> 00:40:23.018
Lower the shields.

00:40:39.603 --> 00:40:41.195
Captain's Log, supplemental.

00:40:41.272 --> 00:40:42.967
Harry is recovering
in Sick Bay,

00:40:43.040 --> 00:40:45.133
and the rest of the away team
is safe and sound.

00:40:45.209 --> 00:40:46.335
As for the drones,

00:40:46.410 --> 00:40:48.275
the Doctor's removed
most of their implants,

00:40:48.345 --> 00:40:51.212
leaving us with four
very troubled children.

00:40:51.282 --> 00:40:52.214
We've sent out calls

00:40:52.283 --> 00:40:53.978
to any Brunali
and Norcadian ships

00:40:54.084 --> 00:40:55.608
that might be
in the vicinity,

00:40:55.686 --> 00:40:57.449
but we haven't gotten
any responses so far,

00:40:57.521 --> 00:40:58.988
and we're still
trying to figure out

00:40:59.056 --> 00:41:00.921
where the other
two came from.

00:41:00.991 --> 00:41:02.549
It may take a while.

00:41:02.626 --> 00:41:04.059
They could use the time.

00:41:04.128 --> 00:41:06.062
They have a great deal
to learn.

00:41:06.130 --> 00:41:08.428
It might help if they
had someone around

00:41:08.499 --> 00:41:10.433
who knew what
they're up against.

00:41:12.002 --> 00:41:14.163
I've never been responsible
for children.

00:41:14.238 --> 00:41:16.706
Mr. Neelix would be
a wiser choice.

00:41:16.774 --> 00:41:17.832
From what I've seen,

00:41:17.908 --> 00:41:20.274
you're the one
they've established a bond with.

00:41:20.344 --> 00:41:22.403
They'll be looking to you
for guidance.

00:41:24.148 --> 00:41:25.615
Perhaps I could...

00:41:25.683 --> 00:41:27.378
help them avoid
some of the obstacles

00:41:27.451 --> 00:41:28.816
I've encountered.

00:41:36.994 --> 00:41:38.859
Do we have to regenerate now?

00:41:38.929 --> 00:41:40.362
Yes.

00:41:40.431 --> 00:41:42.558
But first...

00:41:42.633 --> 00:41:44.294
I was able to salvage

00:41:44.368 --> 00:41:46.359
your assimilation profiles.

00:41:46.437 --> 00:41:48.462
They include your names
and some limited

00:41:48.539 --> 00:41:49.767
biographical data.

00:41:49.840 --> 00:41:51.967
Icheb.

00:41:52.109 --> 00:41:54.236
My name was Icheb.

00:41:54.311 --> 00:41:56.541
Your name is Icheb.

00:41:56.614 --> 00:41:58.912
I remember now.

00:41:58.983 --> 00:42:01.451
It was my father's second name.

00:42:02.553 --> 00:42:05.920
My designation is Mezoti.

00:42:07.224 --> 00:42:09.385
It-it's a pretty name.

00:42:09.460 --> 00:42:11.690
Yes, it is...

00:42:11.762 --> 00:42:13.627
and it's all yours.

00:42:18.168 --> 00:42:19.328
Azan

00:42:19.403 --> 00:42:20.927
and Rebi...

00:42:21.071 --> 00:42:23.335
I'll tell you more
about them tomorrow.

00:42:31.615 --> 00:42:34.982
Computer, decrease
ambient lighting by 60 percent.

00:42:38.789 --> 00:42:39.983
Good night.

00:42:47.765 --> 00:42:49.426
Sweet dreams.
